WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.751 --> 00:00:04.630
Who do you trust
with your deepest secrets?

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.386
And what will you do...

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:14.097
if you found out
they were lying to you?

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.271
Poppy, I need you
to help me.

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:23.982
I wanna know who murdered
my husband.

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:26.109
♪ When the chaos comes ♪

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:29.029
♪ When the chaos comes ♪

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:33.033
♪ In too deep
and there's no way out ♪

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:43.502
♪ When the chaos comes ♪

00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:47.422
We need to be careful.
There are too many questions
left unanswered.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:52.052
-Do you trust her?
-I know my friends.

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:55.764
♪ When the chaos comes ♪

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:57.808
We know what our friends
want us to know,

00:00:57.808 --> 00:00:59.268
and that's all.

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:03.397
♪ The silence is bound
to break ♪

